WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.520
Ethical evaluation is now supported by
binding regulatory enforcement,

2
00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:07.640
primarily through the European Union AI
Act.

3
00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:11.340
The Act uses a risk-based classification
system.

4
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:16.240
Minimal and limited risk systems require
light monitoring and transparency.

5
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:21.300
High risk systems are strictly regulated,
while unacceptable risk systems are

6
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:26.360
outright banned. For sensitive high risk
cases, a fundamental rights impact

7
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:31.320
assessment is mandatory. Under this legal
framework, ethical scrutiny is no

8
00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:35.280
longer just a best practice. It is a
mandate dictated by the system's

9
00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.580
operational risk.
